<div style="font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif; color: #485064; line-height: 1.6;">
  <p style="font-size: 20px; color: #22113A; margin: 0 0 16px;">Your password was changed</p>

  <p>The password for this account was changed on <%= l(@when, format: :long) %>.</p>

  <p>Everything that was signed in has been signed out, including this device if it was.</p>

  <%#
    The only warning somebody gets if this was not them, so it says what to do
    rather than only what happened.
  %>
  <p style="background:#F8E7E9; border:1px solid #E7B9BF; border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px;">
    <strong style="color:#22113A;">If this was not you</strong>, set a new password
    straight away using "Forgotten your password" on the sign-in page, and tell us at
    <%= ENV.fetch("MAIL_REPLY_TO", "support@prachar.test") %>.
  </p>
</div>
